(7397318, 1163088, 124190, '<td valign="top">I seem to be loving the photos of those who like mine.  Wish we could all have tea. :-).  Thank you.</td>', 'I seem to be loving the photos of those who like mine.  Wish we could all have tea. :-).  Thank you.', '2015-08-13 22:37:30.000000', NULL, 0),
